+     content it carries. -->
+
+Customers can rent by the hour. `addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (non-negative integer
+cents per hour). A rental shorter than a day that starts and ends on the hour costs hours x `hourlyPrice`
+(no long-stay discount). An item without an hourly price cannot be rented by the hour: `quote` and `book`
+throw. Rentals of a day or more still start and end at UTC midnight. Hourly bookings take part in clash
+checks and availability like any other period.
